<div class="col-md-10 mb-10">
  <div class="card h-300">
    <div class="card-body">

    <p>
      <strong>Instruction</strong>
      You want to research everything about the company from as many sources as you can
      Talk to people in your network to find current and previous employees
      Read current news stories, and spend time on their website.
      First check company site and then find current news and ask about them in intreview and this shows seriousness and trustability
      be ready to talk about why you’d like to work there and what you can do for them.
    </p>
    <p>
      1. Did I read JD carefully and extracted all requirements and responsibilities and company needs?
      2. Most organizations use the job description to explain exactly what they're looking for in an applicant
      3. Internalize its key details and try to incorporate them into your answers to show cultural fit: while I need to keep my stories intact in since it takes
      time to mater them its important not to destroy literacy in stories for this

    </p>
    <div id="<%= dom_id interview_cheat_sheet %>">
      <p>
        <strong>Date:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.date %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Location:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.location %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Company:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.company %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Position:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.positon %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Interviewers:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.interviewers.html_safe %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Company info:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.company_info.html_safe %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>My pitch:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.my_pitch.html_safe %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Accomplishments skills:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.accomplishments_skills.html_safe %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Reason about position:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.reason_about_position.html_safe %>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>My questions:</strong>
        Offering specific recommendations for their work shows my passion for the job.
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.my_questions.html_safe %>
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Predicted question answers:</strong>
        <%= interview_cheat_sheet.predicted_question_answers.html_safe %>
      </p>

    </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>